DECLARE `An Act in the table of Acts Referred to` IS ONE OF
    `Adoption Act 1976`
    `Adoption Acts 1952 to 1998`
    `An Act for the Union of Great Britain and Ireland`
    `Companies Acts 1963 to 2001`
    `Constitution of the Irish Free State (Saorstát Eireann) Act 1922`
    `Interpretation Act 1889`
    `Interpretation Act 1923`
    `Interpretation Act 1937`
    `Interpretation (Amendment) Act 1993`
    `Ministers and Secretaries (Amendment) (No. 2) Act 1977`
    `Organisation of Working Time Act 1997`
    `Social Welfare Acts`
    `Social Welfare (Consolidation) Act 1993`
    `Standard Time (Amendment) Act 1971`
    `Status of Children Act 1987`
    `Statutory Declarations Act 1938`
    `Survey (Ireland) Acts 1825 to 1870`
    `Valuation Act 2001`

-- src:56 | Adoption Act 1976 | 1976, No. 29
@ref Interpretation Act 2005 'Acts Referred to' table (src:56)
DECLARE `A row of the table of Acts Referred to` HAS
    `the title`                                 IS A STRING
    `the citation printed beside it`            IS A MAYBE STRING
    `the calendar year in that citation`        IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `the consecutive number in that citation`   IS A MAYBE NUMBER

§ `The rows`

-- src:56 | Adoption Act 1976 | 1976, No. 29
@ref Interpretation Act 2005 'Acts Referred to' table, row 1 (src:56)
`Acts Referred to row: Adoption Act 1976` MEANS
    `A row of the table of Acts Referred to` WITH
        `the title`                                 IS "Adoption Act 1976"
        `the citation printed beside it`            IS JUST "1976, No. 29"
        `the calendar year in that citation`        IS JUST 1976
        `the consecutive number in that citation`   IS JUST 29

-- src:57 | Adoption Acts 1952 to 1998
