@ref Interpretation Act 2005 'Acts Referred to' table (src:56-73)
GIVEN a IS AN `An Act in the table of Acts Referred to`
GIVETH A `A row of the table of Acts Referred to`
`the row of Acts Referred to for` a MEANS
    CONSIDER a
    WHEN `Adoption Act 1976`                                                   THEN `Acts Referred to row: Adoption Act 1976`
    WHEN `Adoption Acts 1952 to 1998`                                          THEN `Acts Referred to row: Adoption Acts 1952 to 1998`
    WHEN `An Act for the Union of Great Britain and Ireland`                   THEN `Acts Referred to row: An Act for the Union of Great Britain and Ireland`
    WHEN `Companies Acts 1963 to 2001`                                         THEN `Acts Referred to row: Companies Acts 1963 to 2001`
    WHEN `Constitution of the Irish Free State (Saorstát Eireann) Act 1922`    THEN `Acts Referred to row: Constitution of the Irish Free State (Saorstát Eireann) Act 1922`
    WHEN `Interpretation Act 1889`                                             THEN `Acts Referred to row: Interpretation Act 1889`
    WHEN `Interpretation Act 1923`                                             THEN `Acts Referred to row: Interpretation Act 1923`
    WHEN `Interpretation Act 1937`                                             THEN `Acts Referred to row: Interpretation Act 1937`
    WHEN `Interpretation (Amendment) Act 1993`                                 THEN `Acts Referred to row: Interpretation (Amendment) Act 1993`
    WHEN `Ministers and Secretaries (Amendment) (No. 2) Act 1977`              THEN `Acts Referred to row: Ministers and Secretaries (Amendment) (No. 2) Act 1977`
    WHEN `Organisation of Working Time Act 1997`                               THEN `Acts Referred to row: Organisation of Working Time Act 1997`
    WHEN `Social Welfare Acts`                                                 THEN `Acts Referred to row: Social Welfare Acts`
    WHEN `Social Welfare (Consolidation) Act 1993`                             THEN `Acts Referred to row: Social Welfare (Consolidation) Act 1993`
    WHEN `Standard Time (Amendment) Act 1971`                                  THEN `Acts Referred to row: Standard Time (Amendment) Act 1971`
    WHEN `Status of Children Act 1987`                                         THEN `Acts Referred to row: Status of Children Act 1987`
    WHEN `Statutory Declarations Act 1938`                                     THEN `Acts Referred to row: Statutory Declarations Act 1938`
    WHEN `Survey (Ireland) Acts 1825 to 1870`                                  THEN `Acts Referred to row: Survey (Ireland) Acts 1825 to 1870`
    WHEN `Valuation Act 2001`                                                  THEN `Acts Referred to row: Valuation Act 2001`
